{"sha": "b465400dc72b0e6dc6098ed771fcb796e225ffebf9588f571787dff48782a224", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[What iron needs to rust]\\label{prop:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:needs}", "铁只有同时接触氧气和水才会生锈。水中溶解的盐，", "如冬季撒过盐的道路上或海边的情况，会使生锈", "加快。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{inthelab}[三根铁钉，一周]", "三根干净的铁钉分别放入三支试管中：第一支装", "干燥空气和吸水蒸气的干燥剂；第二支装", "煮沸以除去溶解空气的水，并在水面覆盖一层油；", "第三支一半装自来水，一半留有空气。一周后，", "只有第三根铁钉生锈。", "\\end{inthelab}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=1.2]", "  % tube 1: dry air, drying agent", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {testtube={0.18}{white!80!black}};", "  \\foreach \\x/\\y in {-0.12/0.15,0.08/0.12,-0.02/0.3,0.12/0.32,-0.14/0.42,0.03/0.48}", "    \\fill[black!35] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.05);", "  \\fill[black!45] (-0.03,1.0) rectangle (0.03,2.4);", "  \\fill[black!45] (-0.09,2.4) rectangle (0.09,2.48);", "  \\fill[black!60] (-0.3,2.8) rectangle (0.3,3.1);", "  \\node[anchor=north, align=center] at (0,-0.15) {干燥空气：\\\\ 不生锈};", "  % tube 2: boiled water under oil", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (2.6,0) {testtube={0.7}{omWater!80}};", "  \\fill[yellow!55!orange!60] (2.36,1.85) rectangle (2.84,2.1);", "  \\fill[black!45] (2.57,0.3) rectangle (2.63,1.7);", "  \\fill[black!45] (2.51,1.7) rectangle (2.69,1.78);", "  \\fill[black!60] (2.3,2.8) rectangle (2.9,3.1);", "  \\node[anchor=north, align=center] at (2.6,-0.15) {无空气的水：\\\\ 不生锈};", "  % tube 3: water and air", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (5.2,0) {testtube={0.4}{omWater!80}};", "  \\fill[black!45] (5.17,0.3) rectangle (5.23,2.2);", "  \\fill[black!45] (5.11,2.2) rectangle (5.29,2.28);", "  \\fill[orange!60!brown] (5.15,0.9) rectangle (5.25,1.5);", "  \\node[anchor=north, align=center] at (5.2,-0.15) {有水有空气：\\\\ 生锈};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (-0.15,0.3) -- (-0.9,0.7) node[left, text=black, font=\\footnotesize] {干燥剂};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (2.85,1.98) -- (3.6,2.4) node[right, text=black, font=\\footnotesize] {油};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 三根铁钉实验：铁只有在水与氧气同时接触处才生锈，", "即图中的水面处。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[铝和铜自我保护]\\label{ex:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:protect}", "铝一接触空气中的氧气就会被侵蚀，但生成的薄氧化层", "牢牢附着在金属表面，使其与空气隔绝：", "铝制窗框可使用数十年。铜会缓慢受到", "空气、水和二氧化碳的侵蚀，表面生成一层绿色的膜，", "即铜绿，它同样附着牢固，保护下面的金属。相比之下，", "铁锈会剥落。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[height=6cm]{images/book1/statue-patina.jpg}", "", "{\\small 自由女神像：其铜质表皮覆盖着一层绿色的", "铜绿。照片：Elcobbola，公有领域。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{金属的防护}", "", "\\begin{definition}[镀锌]\\label{def:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:galvanising}", "\\emph{镀锌}\\index{镀锌}是通过将钢材浸入熔融的锌中，使其表面", "覆盖一层锌。锌被空气和水侵蚀，而不是下面的钢；", "即使镀层被划伤，", "附近的锌会先被腐蚀，钢材得以保护。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[铁和钢的防护方法]\\label{prop:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:ways}", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 隔绝水和空气：涂漆、涂油、涂润滑脂、覆盖塑料膜；", "  \\item 镀锌：用锌层代替钢材发生腐蚀；", "  \\item 使用不锈钢，即铁与铬的合金，它", "        借助一层薄而致密的氧化膜保护自身；", "  \\item 在船体上固定锌块：锌块代替钢材被缓慢消耗，", "        并定期更换（其原理", "        将在大学教材中讲解）。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{minipage}[b]{0.52\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\fill[black!35] (0,0) rectangle (5,0.8);", "  \\fill[black!15] (0,0.8) rectangle (2.2,1.1);", "  \\fill[black!15] (2.8,0.8) rectangle (5,1.1);", "  \\fill[omWater!80] (1.6,1.1) rectangle (3.4,1.35);", "  \\fill[omWater!80] (2.2,0.8) rectangle (2.8,1.1);", "  \\draw[black!60] (0,0) rectangle (5,0.8);", "  \\foreach \\x in {1.95,2.1} \\draw[->, omProp, thick] (\\x,1.25) -- (\\x+0.05,1.7);", "  \\node[anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (5.1,0.4) {钢};", "  \\node[anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (5.1,0.95) {锌层};", "  \\node[anchor=south, font=\\footnotesize, align=center] at (2.0,1.75) {锌离子\\\\ 进入水中};", "  \\node[anchor=north, font=\\footnotesize, align=center] at (2.5,-0.05) {划痕处：钢材\\\\ 暴露，周围的锌\\\\ 先被腐蚀};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 划痕后的镀锌板。}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[b]{0.44\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=4.4cm,keepaspectratio]{images/book1/ai/g9-galvanised-railings.jpg}", "", "{\\small 镀锌钢栏杆。}", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:1}", "锌与盐酸反应时放出哪种气体？", "如何检验该气体？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}